<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12.0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial">Cash App gross profit grew 31% year over year with strength in both Commerce Enablement and Financial Solutions. Commerce Enablement gross profit
