our Class A common stock for an aggregate amount of $701 million. As of June 30, 2026, we had $4.6 billion in remaining authorization for repurchases. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-right:2%; font-size:9pt; font-family:Arial">We ended the quarter with $8.8 billion of total liquidity, with $7.9 billion in cash, cash equivalents, restricted cash, and investments in marketable
debt securities, and $900 million available to be withdrawn from our revolving credit facility. Additionally, we had $343 million available to be withdrawn under our warehouse funding facilities. </P>
