</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:9.0pt; font-size:7pt; font-family:Arial"><FONT COLOR="#9a9a9a">Adjusted Net Income (Loss), Adjusted Net Income (Loss) Per Share (Adjusted EPS), and Adjusted Diluted Net Income
