<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:9.0pt; font-size:7pt; font-family:Arial"><FONT COLOR="#9a9a9a">We also exclude from these measures certain acquisition-related and integration costs associated with business combinations, and
