<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:9.0pt; font-size:7pt; font-family:Arial"><FONT COLOR="#9a9a9a">Non-GAAP Cash Flow is a non-GAAP financial measure that represents our net cash provided by operating activities adjusted for
