 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:9.0pt; font-size:7pt; font-family:Arial"><FONT COLOR="#9a9a9a">Adjusted Net Income (Loss), Adjusted EPS, Adjusted Diluted EPS, and non-GAAP
